OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACan noisy phone use on public
OL,4,Atransport be stopped?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It really enrages me. It's just
OL,7,Fdisrespectful." An 18-year-old
OL,8,Fpassenger gives me her view on noisy
OL,9,Fphone use on the Tube.
OL,11,F"After a long day, when London's
OL,12,Falready loud and busy, I get on the
OL,13,Ftrain home and there are three people
OL,14,Fon their phones, playing TikTok out
OL,15,Floud, listening to Spotify on a speaker
OL,16,Fon their phone. I just can't stand it."
OL,18,FShe adds: "I will literally buy someone
OL,19,Fheadphones. Ask me and I will go get
OL,20,Fyou #2 headphones."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
