OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACan noisy phone use on public
OL,4,Atransport be stopped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt seems she holds a majority view on
OL,7,Fso-called loudcasting. Ofcom, YouGov
OL,8,Fand Transport for London have all
OL,9,Fpublished surveys showing that the vast
OL,10,Fmajority of passengers dislike noisy
OL,11,Fphone use.
